Task: operation-tests (8/30, track lrocore_20260909)

Created packages/lro/tests/test_operation.py — 27 tests over five classes:
TestOperationName, TestMetadata, TestFinishing, TestResumePoint, TestAccessors.

Red verified: ImportError on Operation, OperationRecord, OperationNameError.

The set/save split is asserted on every mutator (metadata, resume point) because
it is the whole point of the pair: set_* stages, save_* writes. A reader who
collapsed them would produce a write per field change.

validate_operation_name is exported publicly rather than imported from _names:
ruff resolves alis.build.lro as first-party but alis.build.lro._names as
third-party, so a private-module import can never satisfy the import sorter.
